(30, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-007', 7, 'COMPLETION OF REQUEST FOR THE CREATION OF ONLINE DATA COLLECTION LINK FOR LABORATORY EQUIPMENT INVENTORY', 'Please be informed that the requested online data collection form for the inventory of\r\nlaboratory equipment has been completed and is now available for deployment and\r\nuse through the following link: https://bit.ly/NFALABEQUIPMENT.', '7306e0ab428cd756f89219f7fe9a8558.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 16, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 11:08:11', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:10', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(31, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-008', 8, 'CERTIFICATION FOR DIGITAL SIGNATURE', 'This is to request for your verification and signature on the attached templated\r\nCertifications and Bulk Application Enrollment form from the Department of\r\nInformation and Communications Technology (DICT) relative to the NFA\'s application\r\nfor the issuance of digital certificates which will enable our employees to digitally sign\r\ndocuments.', '246039aa34fd4028a5940e25d130915b.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 12, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 11:12:07', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:17', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(32, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-009', 9, 'ASSSESSMENT JUSTIFYING THE SUITABUILITY OF CONTRACT RENEWAL FOR THE PROCUREMENT OF INTERNET SUBSCRIPTION', 'Pursuant to Section 18 of the New Government Procurement Ad (NGPA). 􀀐 Entities are encouraged to consider the renewal of tontrads for regular and recurring services to ensure the timely and unintenupted implementation of procurement projects. provided that the renewal period shall not exceed one (1) \r\nyear.', 'a8d87aea80d9c5c07a1e2b79b05b63c0.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 5, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 12:05:47', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:49', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(33, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-010', 10, 'FOLLOW UP ON REQUEST FOR APPROVAL TO CHANGE PROCUREMENT MODE FOR PROVISION OF PABX AS-A-SERVICE', 'May we respectfully request for the status of the Request for Approval to Change\r\nProcurement Mode for the Provision of PA BX-as-a-Service\r\n(CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-05), dated 02 June 2026,\r\nThe proposed change in procurement mode was recommended to facilitate the\r\ntimely implementation of the PABX modernization initiative and to ensure the\r\ncontinuous provision of reliable telecommunication services in support of the\r\nAgency\'s operational requirements .', '65c6281824f7f6ed257bba43507432eb.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 5, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 12:12:26', 24, '2026-06-22 13:39:15', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(34, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-011', 11, 'PHASE 3 IMPLEMENTATION STATUS- PHASE 2', 'As part of the agreement during the HRIS PMT regular meeting on 4 June 2026 in the\r\nafternoon, the Designated Subject Matter Expert (SMEs) for Phase 2 which covers\r\nModules 2, 3, 4, 5 and 13 needs to be completed on 5 June 2026 and shall form part of\r\ntheir Work From Home (WFH) accomplishments. However, per monitoring as of 9 June\r\n2026 3:00 pm, the Phase 2 - User Acceptance Testing (UAT) remains incomplete.', '6e16f36b69c781b89d9f4d4c98a9bda6.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 4, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 12:17:03', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:57', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(35, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-012', 12, 'NOTICE OF TRAINING FOR BENTSAI HANDHELD PRINTER', 'In line with the upcoming implementation of the MAFRA-KRC Project for the Rice\r\nSupply Chain for Seed and Milled Rice Quality and Buffer Stocks in the Philippines, all\r\nconcerned personnel of the CPMSD-ICTSD Hardware and Network Infrastructure Unit\r\n(HNIU) are hereby directed to participate of the scheduled product training on the\r\nBentsai Handheld Printer on June 10, 2026 (Wednesday) 10:00 A.M at CPMSO\r\nConference Room, NFA Central Office, Visayas Avenue, Quezon City\r\nThe activity aims to provide participants with a comprehensive understanding and\r\nproper operation of the Handheld Printer.', '861fe2da1cbed6d0fa2bc647baa5ab8b.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 12, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 12:20:34', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:42', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(36, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-013', 13, 'USER ACCEPTANCE TEST (UAT) PHASE 2 PROGRESS REPORT', 'In compliance with the milestones, deliverables, and implementation schedule\r\nprescribed under the Terms of Reference (TOR) for the Human Resource Information\r\nSystem (HRIS) Project, and pursuant to the User Acceptance Testing (UAT) activities\r\nscheduled and facilitated by CTX Technologies, Inc., we respectfully submit the Phase 2\r\nUAT Progress Report covering the following module', 'c8f75bf39d3f6a40835ccac5c107c015.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 22, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 12:25:03', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:32', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(37, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-014', 14, 'AMENDMENT TO CPMSD-ICTSD-2025-10-25 MEMORANDUM DATED 27 OCTOBER 2025 RE ICTSD TWG MEMBERSHIPS', 'In the interest of service and in compliance with the issued Special Order Numbers AO-\r\n2025-10-008 dated 1 October 2025 re: Establishment of NFA Computer Emergency\r\nResponse Team (NFA - CERT) and AO - 2025 - 09-76 dated 17 September 2025 re:\r\nCreation of Data Protection Committee (DPC), the following ICTSD personnel are hereby\r\ndirected to perform the following tasks, to wit:', 'b81219f38703377b2fe0fab962a5d8a3.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 10, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 12:35:26', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:25', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(38, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-015', 15, 'WAREHOUSE MANAGEMENT SYSTEM', 'In line with the ongoing development of the National Food Authority\'s Warehouse\r\nManagement System (WMS) Project, the Corporate Planning and Management\r\nServices Department (CPMSD), through the Information and Communications\r\nTechnology Services Division (ICTSD), has successfully conducted benchmarking\r\nactivities, market scoping, and requirements gathering in selected warehouses in\r\nRegions Ill and IV.', '9b6cddf87fe62e984d32254900de655c.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 16, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 13:31:13', 24, '2026-06-22 13:38:00', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(39, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-016', 16, 'PROCUREMENT OF JCT EQUIPMENT FOR CY 2026', 'Please be informed that the Central Office will facilitate the nationwi.d.e .. p..LQ.c .. w:􀃏.rti􀃐.nLoL _j\r\nthe !CT equipment in the PS-DBM via its virtual store/e-Market Place for CY 2026. The\r\nmanner of purchase will be on a per region basis. Hence, the PS-DBM will deliver the\r\nallocated JCT equipment to your respective Regional Offices. Thus, we request the\r\nofficial endorsement of the designated JCT Equipment Inspector of the Regional Offices\r\nwho will also serve as the focal person for all delivered equipment. As for the\r\ndistribution list, the PS-DBM may have yet to issue the updated unit price per\r\nequipment; thus, CPMSD will issue another Memorandum for the rationalized resource\r\nallocation per Regional and Branch Office.', '175d1e7025e20e7c4ebd2f5cbaf4366b.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 12, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 13:32:52', 24, '2026-06-22 13:37:54', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(40, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-017', 17, 'UPDATE ON THE PROCUREMENT OF ICT EQUIPMENT', 'This pertains to the inquiries for updates on the CPMSD Memorandum coded with\r\nCPMSD-ICTSD-2026-03-32 dated 31 March 2026 re: Procurement of ICT Equipment for\r\nCY 2026.', 'c3d4d9b737f04981a7b402465ecfdd40.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 12, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 13:34:55', 24, '2026-06-22 13:37:45', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(41, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-018', 18, 'REPORTS OF GSIS NOTIFICATIONS ON UNPAID PREMIUM CONTRIBUTIONS', 'This is to respectfully request to verify the status of the corresponding GSIS premium\r\nremittances and records of employees to determine whether the notifications resulted\r\nfrom delayed remittance posting, processing timelines, reconciliation issues, or other\r\nrelated concerns.', '91cab96b3e297a80a9394d5ed61ce1b3.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 19, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 13:36:19', 14, '2026-06-22 11:09:03', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
(42, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-019', 19, 'HNIU Bl MONTHLY ACCOMPLISHMENT REPORT FOR THE PERIOD COVERED: 1-15 JUNE 2026', 'n compliance with the monitoring and reporting requirements under the revised Strategic Performance Management System (SPMS), the following accomplishments and project updates of the Hardware and Network Infrastructure Unit (HNIU), ICT Services Division, are respectfully submitted for review and evaluation covering the period 1-15 June 2026.', '2ab9c88ad6035f9f9a8a1276e2f85ad7.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 12, NULL, 24, '2026-06-19 13:38:36', NULL, NULL, 14, '2026-06-22 11:06:28', 'Received'),
