(45, 'CPMSD-ICTSD-2026-06-021', 21, 'NEW ORGANIZATIONAL UNIT UNDER THE CPMSD- ICTSD', 'In the exigency of service and in view of the fast-paced demands of technology, the\r\nInformation and Communications Technology Services Division (ICTSD) is hereby\r\ndivided into three (3) units and shall be composed of the following effective 1 July\r\n2026', 'cbe66b66fc38f769a6a10d2232ca798c.pdf', NULL, 'Memorandum', 12, 12, NULL, 24, '2026-06-22 11:09:14', 14, '2026-06-22 11:14:21', NULL, NULL, 'Released'),
